  "copy440": "Garden Frente Mar Bombinhas · Deck and Superior · Pousada Gaúcha",
  "copy441": "Garden Frente Mar Deck (exclusive deck + balcony) and Garden Frente Mar Superior (upstairs balcony). 40–45m², queen-size, 2 TVs 43\" Netflix, full kitchen. Only guesthouse rooms facing the sea in the center of Bombinhas.",
  "copy442": "Garden Frente Mar Deck",
  "copy443": "Apartment facing Praia de Bombinhas with private balcony in the bedroom and exclusive deck on the garden level — two outdoor spaces with sea views. A bedroom with a queen-size double bed. Living room with sofa bed for two more people. Kitchen with sink counter, minibar, stove, microwave and basic utensils. Two 43\" TVs with Netflix. Split air conditioning in the bedroom and living room. Telephone.",
  "copy444": "40 to 45m² · 2 adults + 2 children · bedroom balcony + private deck · direct sea view · 2 43\" TVs with Netflix · full kitchen · sofa bed · split air conditioning",
  "copy445": "Private balcony in the room and exclusive deck with direct views of Praia de Bombinhas.",
  "copy446": "Garden Frente Mar Superior",
  "copy447": "Apartment on the upper floor with a private balcony in the bedroom and direct views of Praia de Bombinhas. The greater height opens up the horizon and provides a more panoramic perspective than the deck level. A bedroom with a queen-size double bed. Living room with sofa bed for two more people. Kitchen with sink counter, minibar, stove, microwave and basic utensils. Two 43\" TVs with Netflix. Split air conditioning in the bedroom and living room. Telephone.",
  "copy448": "40 to 45m² · 2 adults + 2 children · private bedroom balcony · elevated direct sea view · 2 43\" TVs with Netflix · full kitchen · sofa bed · split air conditioning",
  "copy449": "Private balcony in the room with elevated frontal views of Praia de Bombinhas.",
  "copy450": "Garden Studio 01 Dormitório",
  "copy451": "Apartment with the same size and internal structure as the other Garden rooms. No balcony, but with a view of the sea from the bedroom window — side, with the beach and palm trees visible from the window. A real sea view, from a different angle. The best value for money on the block for those who want the Bloco Garden at a lower price. A bedroom with a queen-size double bed. Living room with sofa bed for two more people. Kitchen with sink counter, minibar, stove, microwave and basic utensils. Two 43\" TVs with cable TV and Netflix. Split air conditioning in the bedroom and living room. Telephone.",
  "copy452": "40 to 45m² · 2 adults + 2 children · side sea view from the bedroom window · no balcony · 2 43\" TVs with cable TV and Netflix · full kitchen · sofa bed · split air conditioning",
  "copy453": "Side view of the beach and sea from the bedroom window. No balcony.",
