  "copy469": "What is the difference between Garden Deck, Garden Superior and Garden Studio?",
  "copy470": "Garden Frente Mar Deck: balcony in the room with sea views and exclusive deck on the garden level. There are two private outdoor spaces.",
  "copy471": "Garden Frente Mar Superior: Private balcony in the bedroom with sea views, upstairs. Higher and more panoramic view, without the exclusive deck.",
  "copy472": "Garden Studio 01 Dormitório: without balcony, with side views through the deck to the garden and the sea in the background. Same size and internal structure. It has cable TV in addition to Netflix.",
  "copy473": "Do Garden rooms have sea views?",
  "copy474": "Garden Frente Mar Deck and Garden Frente Mar Superior directly overlook Praia de Bombinhas. The Garden Studio has a side view of the deck, with the sea in the background.",
  "copy475": "What is the size of the Garden rooms?",
  "copy476": "40 to 45m². They all have a bedroom, living room, equipped kitchen and private external space (except the Studio, which does not have a balcony).",
  "copy477": "How many people can fit in the Garden apartments?",
  "copy478": "Two adults in the queen-size bed and two more people on the living-room sofa bed. Ideal capacity: 2 adults and 2 children.",
  "copy479": "Do Garden rooms have Netflix?",
  "copy480": "Yes. All Garden rooms have two 43\" TVs with Netflix. The Garden Studio also has cable TV in addition to streaming.",
  "copy481": "Garden Frente Mar — the only guesthouse rooms with sea views in the center of Bombinhas",
  "copy482": "Bloco Garden at Pousada Gaúcha has 8 apartments measuring 40 to 45m² in central Bombinhas. They are the only inn rooms in the town centre with direct views of Praia de Bombinhas. Three categories: Garden Frente Mar Deck (with a private deck and balcony), Garden Frente Mar Superior (upper-floor balcony) and Garden Studio 01 Dormitório (side view, no balcony). All have a bedroom with a queen-size bed, a living room with a sofa bed, a kitchen with a stove and microwave, two 43\" TVs with Netflix, split air conditioning in the bedroom and living room, and space for 2 adults and 2 children.",
  "copy483": "Three types of apartments within the Garden",
  "copy484": "What all Garden Apartments have",
  "copy485": "Why beachfront rooms in Bombinhas are rare",
  "copy486": "Bombinhas has dozens of inns and holiday apartments close to the beach. But having the room with the window opening to the sea — not the street, not the parking lot, not the neighboring building — is different. In the center of Bombinhas, the only guesthouse rooms with this view are the 6 on the Garden Deck and Garden Superior.",
  "copy487": "The difference is practical: you wake up, open the window and check the sea conditions before deciding whether to go to the beach early or later.",
  "copy488": "Quick questions",
  "copy489": "Book through the website and guarantee the best value. If you want help choosing between Deck, Superior or Studio, talk to us on WhatsApp.",
  "copy490": "Bloco Gaúcha · Apartments with barbecue in Bombinhas",
