  "copy513": "Which Bloco Gaúcha apartments have a barbecue?",
  "copy514": "The 01-Bedroom Apartment Gaúcha and the 02-Bedroom Apartment Gaúcha have a balcony with a private barbecue. The Gaucha Suite does not have a balcony.",
  "copy515": "What is the difference between the Gaúcha Suite and the apartments?",
  "copy516": "The Gaúcha Suite is a unique environment, with a bedroom, mini kitchen and bathroom, no separate living room and no balcony. The 1 and 2 bedroom apartments have a living room with a sofa bed, a full kitchen and a balcony with a barbecue.",
  "copy517": "How many people can fit in the 2-bedroom apartment?",
