  "copy519": "Do the Bloco Gaúcha apartments have Netflix?",
  "copy520": "The TVs on the Bloco Gaúcha are 32\" with cable TV channels. The TVs with Netflix are the 43\" on the Bloco Garden.",
  "copy521": "Bloco Gaúcha — apartments with balcony and private barbecue in Bombinhas",
  "copy522": "Bloco Gaúcha brings together the largest apartments in Pousada Gaúcha. There are three types: Gaúcha Suite (unique environment with mini kitchen, without balcony), 01-bedroom Gaúcha Apartment and 02-bedroom Gaúcha Apartment, both with living room, sofa bed, full kitchen and balcony with private barbecue. All have split air conditioning, telephone, 32\" TVs with cable TV channels and a bathroom with shower and hairdryer. It is the choice of those who come with their families and stay for several days.",
