  "copy524": "What All Bloco Gaúcha Accommodations Have",
  "copy525": "Book through the website and guarantee the best value. If you want help choosing between the suite and the 1 or 2 bedroom apartments, contact us via WhatsApp.",
  "copy526": "Bloco Praia · Seafront and side apartments · Pousada Gaúcha",
  "copy527": "Beach Suite, 1 side bedroom, 1 seafront bedroom, 1 upper seafront bedroom and 2 bedrooms. Balconies overlooking Praia de Bombinhas, equipped kitchen and split air conditioning.",
  "copy528": "Beach Suite",
  "copy529": "Equipped with a double box bed, a 32\" TV with cable channels, split air conditioning, a telephone and a kitchenette with a minibar, stove, microwave and basic utensils. Bathroom with shower and hairdryer. The suite has a balcony with a side sea view.",
  "copy530": "Double box bed · 32\" TV with cable TV · split air conditioning · mini kitchen · sea side balcony · bathroom with shower and hairdryer",
