  "copy533": "One bedroom with a double box bed, a kitchen with a minibar, stove, microwave and basic utensils, a living room with a sofa bed for two, two 32\" TVs with cable channels, split air conditioning in both rooms and a telephone. Bathroom with shower and hairdryer. The apartment has two side balconies, one in the bedroom and one in the living room.",
  "copy534": "1 bedroom · living room with sofa bed for 2 · 2 32\" TVs with cable TV · split air conditioning in both environments · equipped kitchen · two side balconies",
